sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Gradio UI (app.py, analyze)
    participant P as predict() (inference.py)
    participant M as BERTurk model (models/berturk_v1)

    Note over UI,M: Startup (NFR-2)
    UI->>P: load()
    alt Model folder exists
        P->>M: load_model() once, on CPU
        M-->>P: model and tokenizer kept in memory
        P-->>UI: backend "berturk"
    else Model folder missing
        P-->>UI: raises ModelNotFoundError
        UI-->>U: App stops with a message (folder path, ABSA_BACKEND=mock)
    end

    U->>UI: Enter review, click Analiz et (or press Enter)
    UI->>P: predict(text or "")

    alt Valid text (happy path)
        P->>P: Clean and mask personal data (as in training)
        P->>M: Tokenize, truncate to 128 tokens, forward pass
        M-->>P: 7 x 4 logits
        P->>P: Softmax, most likely label and its probability per aspect
        P-->>UI: dict with all 7 aspects, each {label, confidence}
        UI->>P: is_truncated(text)
        P-->>UI: True if the review is longer than 128 tokens
        UI->>UI: Split mentioned aspects from yok aspects (FR-4)
        UI->>UI: Map keys to display names (ASPECT_DISPLAY, LABEL_DISPLAY)
        UI-->>U: Result table (Özellik, Duygu, Güven), yok accordion
        opt Review was truncated (FR-7)
            UI-->>U: Note: only the first part of the review was analyzed
        end
    else Empty or whitespace-only text (FR-6)
        P-->>UI: raises ValueError
        UI-->>U: Warning message, empty result table
    else Text is not a str
        P-->>UI: raises TypeError
        UI-->>U: Same warning message, empty result table
    end
